package lattice:plugin-host@0.1.0;

/// Mirrors `ConfigRegistry` + `OptionType`/`OptionSpec` (lattice-config).
/// The guest declares a typed option (name + type_label + default + doc);
/// the host registers via `register_with_typeid` into the *same* registry
/// core options live in, so `:set` / `:describe-option` / `:customize` treat
/// plugin options uniformly. Values round-trip as strings (the `OptionType`
/// parse/format contract). Populated in PH7.10.
interface config {}
